GPShell 3.0.0

* GPShell3 is the preferred command-line interface.
* Add SCP11a, delegated management, DAP, and receipt workflows.
* Publish signed Windows x86 and x64 shared-library SDK archives.
* Keep legacy GPShell available for existing scripts.

Previous releases

* Support for CAT/STK ETSI TS 102 226 installation parameters.
